@startuml kairos-member-viewing-giving-summary-sequence
title Member Viewing Giving Summary

actor Member
participant "Member App" as MemberApp
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Member -> MemberApp: Open "My Giving"
MemberApp -> API: GET /finance/my-giving
API -> DB: SELECT payments and pledges for member
DB --> API: rows
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK {payments, pledges}

MemberApp --> Member: Show list + summary + HMRC report options

@enduml
